    "description": "Gallery app is simple, modern, light and fast photo gallery and picture manager app for viewing and organizing your photos and videos. \r\n\r\n<b>Main features:</b>\r\n\ud83c\udf1f Beautiful simple and fast photo gallery\r\n\ud83c\udf1f Quickly search pictures, GIF, videos and albums\r\n\ud83c\udf1f Use the photo viewer to sort and view files\r\n\ud83c\udf1f Easy to share pictures and videos to social media, email or anywhere else\r\n\ud83c\udf1f Show photo and video details\r\n\ud83c\udf1f Photo manager allows you to rename, delete, copy, move pictures, videos and GIFs\r\n\ud83c\udf1f Set any picture as wallpaper\r\n\ud83c\udf1f Modern photo and video gallery\r\n\ud83c\udf1f Zoom photos and GIFs easily with gestures\r\n\ud83c\udf1f Photo slideshow\r\n\ud83c\udf1f Dark mode",
